    { date="2026-09-10", lines={ "邪恶 DK：修复亡者魔导师偶尔生成在极端高低差位置的问题", "生存猎人：修复野火炸弹伤害与「合而为一」和控制效果的交互", "神圣骑士：修复选光铸时天堂回响不生效", "恢复萨满：宁静之雨现在正确缩短治疗之雨 0.5 秒施法", "地下堡：暮光墓穴「脱缰的洛阿」变体加入探险者协会补给" }, linesEn={ "Unholy DK: Magus of the Dead no longer spawns at extreme vertical offsets", "Survival Hunter: Wildfire Bomb damage / Strike As One crowd-control interactions fixed", "Holy Paladin: Ringing of the Heavens now works as Lightsmith", "Resto Shaman: Soothing Rain properly reduces Healing Rain cast time by 0.5s", "Delves: Explorer's League Supplies added to Twilight Crypts 'Loosed Loa'" }, refs={ { { t="spell", id=390196, zh="亡者魔导师", en="Magus of the Dead" } }, { { t="spell", id=259495, zh="野火炸弹", en="Wildfire Bomb" }, { t="spell", id=1251717, zh="羁绊共狩", en="Strike as One" } }, { { t="spell", id=1241542, zh="天堂回响", en="Ringing of the Heavens" } }, { { t="spell", id=1252874, zh="宁静之雨", en="Soothing Rain" }, { t="spell", id=73920, zh="治疗之雨", en="Healing Rain" } }, {  } } },
